    "id": 85004062650,
    "body_text": "Hi Swati,\r\n\r\nWas trying to reach you over the phone.\r\n\r\n[image: 26656_SB DIY _ Catalog page Carousel Images update - Removal of\r\nOffers part.jpg]\r\n\r\nFor the above mentioned banner use the line - *The sound of your growing\r\nbusiness.*\r\n\r\nAlso use another banner where the line needs to be changed. We are using\r\nthe below mentioned banner in Slot 2 of the carousel. Here in the below\r\nmentioned banner use the line - *Get instant voice alerts on every payment.*\r\n\r\n[image: Slot 3 (1).jpg]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Tue, Aug 12, 2025 at 5:18 PM Swati Singh <\r\nsupport@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Ashish Kumar,\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> PFA\r\n>\r\n> On Tue, 12 Aug at 5:15 PM , Swati Singh <\r\n> support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com> wrote:\r\n> Hi Ashish Kumar,\r\n>\r\n> ​PFA revised banner\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Tue, 12 Aug at 5:10 PM , Swati Singh <\r\n> support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com> wrote:\r\n> Hi Ashish Kumar,\r\n>\r\n> PFA\r\n>\r\n> On Tue, 12 Aug at 11:28 AM , Swati Singh <\r\n> support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com> wrote:\r\n> Hi Ashish Kumar,\r\n>\r\n> Please find the edit banner attached below.\r\n>\r\n> On Mon, 11 Aug at 11:11 AM , Zeeshan Ekram <\r\n> support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com> wrote:\r\n> ​@Swati\r\n>\r\n> Please do the needful.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Regards\r\n> Zeeshan Ekram\r\n> Marketing Design\r\n>\r\n> 26656:2424999\r\n>\r\n\r\n\r\n-- \r\nRegards,\r\nAshish Kumar\r\nGrowth - DIY Acquisitions (P4B)\r\n+91 8861909288\r\n\r\n",
    "body": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Swati,<div><br></div>\n<div>Was trying to reach you over the phone.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://indattachment.freshdesk.com/inline/attachment?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6ODUwMDE2NTEzNDEsImRvbWFpbiI6InBheXRtLWRlc2lnbm9jbC5mcmVzaGRlc2suY29tIiwiYWNjb3VudF9pZCI6MjQyNDk5OX0.3-k0G9488ug-SPPCyfWOHxuBrPIsPJemRYcPkkIlUGY\" data-id=\"85001651341\" alt=\"26656_SB DIY _ Catalog page Carousel Images update - Removal of Offers part.jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"332\"><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>For the above mentioned banner use the line - <b>The sound of your growing business.</b>\n</div>\n<div><b><br></b></div>\n<div>Also use another banner where the line needs to be changed. We are using the below mentioned banner in Slot 2 of the carousel. Here in the below mentioned banner use the line - <b>Get instant voice alerts on every payment.</b>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://indattachment.freshdesk.com/inline/attachment?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6ODUwMDE2NTEzNDIsImRvbWFpbiI6InBheXRtLWRlc2lnbm9jbC5mcmVzaGRlc2suY29tIiwiYWNjb3VudF9pZCI6MjQyNDk5OX0.XAmF5xoXi0CcJf60qR3mh1DkYod0UPt4_4JXBC1fsCw\" data-id=\"85001651342\" alt=\"Slot 3 (1).jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"331\"><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div>\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"freshdesk_quote\"><blockquote class=\"freshdesk_quote\">\n<div>On Tue, Aug 12, 2025 at 5:18 PM Swati Singh &lt;<a href=\"mailto:support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com\" rel=\"noreferrer\">support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\n</div>\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px'>\n\t<div style='font-fa