                On\n                            Mon, 11 Aug at 11:11 AM\n                            <span>,  Zeeshan Ekram &lt;<a href=\"mailto:support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">support@paytm-designocl.freshdesk.com</a>&gt;  wrote:\n                            <div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px'>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">​@Swati</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<br>Please do the needful.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Regards</div>\n<div>Zeeshan Ekram</div>\n<div>Marketing Design</div>\n</div></div>\n<div>\n                          \n                        </div>\n</div>\n                          </span>\n</blockquote>\n                        </div>\n</div>\n                          </span>\n</blockquote>\n                        </div>\n</div>\n                          </span>\n</blockquote>\n                        </div>\n</div>\n                          </span>\n</blockquote>\n                        </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Regards,<div>Ashish Kumar</div>\n<div>Growth - DIY Acquisitions (P4B)</div>\n<div>+91 8861909288</div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div></div>\n</blockquote></div>",
